Deze code compileert niet. Welke functies moeten `async` worden? Duid alle juiste antwoorden aan.

```ts
function multiply(a: number, b: number): Promise<number> {
    return new Promise<number>((resolve) => {
        setTimeout(() => resolve(a * b), 1000);
    });
}

function getArea(width: number, height: number): Promise<number> {
    const area = await multiply(width, height);
    return area;
}

function printArea() {
    const area = await getArea(3, 4);
    console.log(`Oppervlakte: ${area}`);
}

function main() {
    printArea();
}
```

